{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43333","headline":"天骥呈材 · 卢征","name":"天骥呈材","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异产应尧年，龙媒顺制牵。\n权奇初得地，躞蹀欲行天。\n讵假调金埒，宁须动玉鞭。\n嘶风深有恋，逐日定无前。\n周满夸常驭，燕昭恨不传。\n应知流赭汗，来自海西偏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢征","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}